2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Homomorphic\040Encryption\072\040Theory\040\046\040Applications)
/Author (Jaydip\040Sen)
/Subject (The\040goal\040of\040this\040chapter\040is\040to\040present\040a\040survey\040of\040homomorphic\040encryption\040techniques\040and\040their\040applications\056\040After\040a\040detailed\040discussion\040on\040the\040introduction\040and\040motivation\040of\040the\040chapter\054\040we\040present\040some\040basic\040concepts\040of\040cryptography\056\040The\040fundamental\040theories\040of\040homomorphic\040encryption\040are\040then\040discussed\040with\040suitable\040examples\056\040The\040chapter\040then\040provides\040a\040survey\040of\040some\040of\040the\040classical\040homomorphic\040encryption\040schemes\040existing\040in\040the\040current\040literature\056\040Various\040applications\040and\040salient\040properties\040of\040homomorphic\040encryption\040schemes\040are\040then\040discussed\040in\040detail\056\040The\040chapter\040then\040introduces\040the\040most\040important\040and\040recent\040research\040direction\040in\040the\040filed\040\055\040fully\040homomorphic\040encryption\056\040A\040significant\040number\040of\040propositions\040on\040fully\040homomorphic\040encryption\040is\040then\040discussed\056\040Finally\054\040the\040chapter\040concludes\040by\040outlining\040some\040emerging\040research\040trends\040in\040this\040exicting\040field\040of\040cryptography\056)
/Keywords (17\040Jul\0402013\054\040arXiv\072\040Cryptography\040and\040Security\054\040Homomorphic\040encryption\054\040Cryptography)
>>
